Z||000011||California Kid||07-15-2001||07:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AkursedX:<BR><B>Thanks alot.  Who knows when I will get back up there.  Here's a pic of my engine bay, and I'm not even done with the diassembly yet.  So who knows when I'll be back on the road. <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P7150012.JPG">  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh my aching back !!! Hope you find the problem real soon.  Here's a tip that could save your deck lid seal, remove it while you're jumping in and out of there. If you lean on it too hard the bulb will tear off the seal base.<BR>||||reg||1
