Z||000013||AkursedX||07-15-2001||08:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by banditbalz:<BR><B>Joe, glad to hear you and Justin made it back! I don't know where this pic came from, so I would assume you took it. Hope you don't mind me posting it. Don't worry about the spare tire cover. As long as I have it for the Toronto show on Sept 15.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No, I don't mind you psoting that pic.  I'm glad you like it enough to post it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  And I hope to have it all back together by the end of the week, so I should get it back to you next week, maybe the week after.<BR>||||reg||1
